// prompt: the unit that the head name of atom a declares, by its exact name (no interning: a head that names no declared unit has no row,
// so its atom names a kernel relation only through the prelude short name join).
def Gate.factHead(w: Resolve.W, g: Ast.G, a: I64): Coll.Option[I64] = Gate.factUnitOf(w, Resolve.sym(w, Resolve.tokT(g, Ast.tok(g, a)), false))

